{"id":5845,"date":"2020-10-30T18:33:06","date_gmt":"2020-10-30T18:33:06","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/?p=5845"},"modified":"2022-07-25T16:06:01","modified_gmt":"2022-07-25T16:06:01","slug":"lets-talk-mitvahs","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/blog\/lets-talk-mitvahs\/","title":{"rendered":"Let&#8217;s Talk Mitvah&#8217;s"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"gmail_default\">JAMMIN&#8217; DJs is well known for our production and DJ talent.\u00a0 This comes to a whole new level when it comes to our Bar Mitzvah and our Bat mitzvah services.\u00a0 We take great pride in working with our clients and learning the vision they have for their son or daughter&#8217;s big day.\u00a0 We start off by sending our clients our complimentary online planning forms that detail every aspect of their event.\u00a0 Including our online music request, and guest request forms, where you can add your music requests to our &#8220;Must Play&#8221;, &#8220;Play if Possible&#8221;, and &#8220;Do Not Play&#8221; Lists.<\/div>\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">Once we have your planning forms and requests we set up a consultation meeting to make sure we have all of our information correct so we can dial everything in for your mitzvah!<\/div>\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">Next is our staff, we have professionally trained DJs, Emcee&#8217;s, Dancers, and Lighting technicians!\u00a0 Our entire staff is professional and high energy whose primary focus is making sure your Mitzvah goes exactly how you envision it.\u00a0 Depending on the size of the production you will have several of our staff there for set up, pre-event activities, and the Mitzvah itself.\u00a0 Our staff is very interactive and will guide you through all of the activities, dances, and games that you choose for your event.<\/div>\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"gmail_default\">Now let&#8217;s talk about our gear!\u00a0 JAMMIN&#8217; DJs only uses state of the art professional equipment from trusted brands.\u00a0 We offer packages from a Micro Mitzvah to a Super Mitzvah and everything in between.\u00a0 Our lighting is rivaled by no other.\u00a0 We offer intelligent lighting, custom gobos with your own logo, concert laser systems, up-lighting, decor lighting, atmospherics, even cold sparks!\u00a0 Our sound system is impeccable!\u00a0 We use a JBL VRX array system paired with Pioneer DJ controllers and Shure Microphones.\u00a0 Put all of this together, and you get sound clarity and quality that is awesome!\u00a0 Take a look at our pictures and videos and you will see that our attention to detail and our love for productions and our clients is unmatched.\u00a0 Don&#8217;t trust your Barmitzvah, or Batmitzvah\u00a0to just anyone.\u00a0 Use a trusted Mitzvah entertainment provider JAMMIN&#8217; DJs!<\/div>\n<div>\n\n\t\t<style>\n\t\t\t#gallery-1 {\n\t\t\t\tmargin: auto;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-1 .gallery-item {\n\t\t\t\tfloat: left;\n\t\t\t\tmargin-top: 10px;\n\t\t\t\ttext-align: center;\n\t\t\t\twidth: 16%;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-1 img {\n\t\t\t\tborder: 2px solid #cfcfcf;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-1 .gallery-caption {\n\t\t\t\tmargin-left: 0;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\/* see gallery_shortcode() in wp-includes\/media.php *\/\n\t\t<\/style>\n\t\t<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-5845 gallery-columns-6 gallery-size-thumbnail'><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/Mitzvah-Allie-3-5e8aba9002ebf.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/Mitzvah-Allie-3-5e8aba9002ebf-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"A group of people posing in front of a sign that says allie.\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/202